{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "titanic-ml-service-collection",
    "name": "Titanic ML Service — Pertemuan 11",
    "description": "Koleksi request untuk Express Gateway (port 3000) dan FastAPI ML Service (port 8000). \n\n**Urutan penggunaan:**\n1. Jalankan 'Login Express Gateway' → token otomatis tersimpan ke variable `express_token`\n2. Gunakan endpoint `/api/*` — token sudah otomatis terpasang\n3. Untuk akses langsung ke FastAPI, jalankan 'Login FastAPI ML' terlebih dahulu",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "express_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ml_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "express_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ml_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Express Gateway",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Express Gateway",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('express_token', res.access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token berhasil disimpan', () => pm.expect(res.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('Login gagal', () => { throw new Error('Tidak ada access_token'); });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"mahasiswa\",\n  \"password\": \"alitkicau\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login ke Express Gateway. Password default: `alitkicau`. Token otomatis tersimpan ke variable `express_token`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Login berhasil",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"mahasiswa\",\n  \"password\": \"alitkicau\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{express_url}}/auth/login" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"bearer\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Login gagal",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"mahasiswa\",\n  \"password\": \"salah\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{express_url}}/auth/login" }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Kredensial salah\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Predict Single (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{express_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"features\": [3, 0, 22, 1, 0, 7.25]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/api/predict",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predict"]
            },
            "description": "Prediksi satu penumpang via Express Gateway.\n\n**features:** `[Pclass, Sex, Age, SibSp, Parch, Fare]`\n\nContoh ini: penumpang kelas 3, laki-laki, 22 tahun → Jack Dawson dari film Titanic"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Prediksi berhasil",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": \"mahasiswa\",\n  \"result\": {\n    \"prediction\": 0,\n    \"label\": \"Tidak Selamat\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.87,\n    \"cached\": false,\n    \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Predict Single — Kemungkinan Selamat",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{express_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"features\": [1, 1, 29, 0, 0, 211.34]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/api/predict",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predict"]
            },
            "description": "Prediksi penumpang dengan profil kemungkinan selamat tinggi.\n\nKelas 1, perempuan, 29 tahun, tiket mahal — mirip profil Rose dari film Titanic"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Batch Predict (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{express_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"features\": [3, 0, 22, 1, 0, 7.25] },\n    { \"features\": [1, 1, 29, 0, 0, 211.34] },\n    { \"features\": [2, 0, 35, 0, 0, 26.0] },\n    { \"features\": [3, 1, 18, 0, 1, 14.45] }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/api/batch-predict",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "batch-predict"]
            },
            "description": "Prediksi banyak penumpang sekaligus. Mengirim array of features."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Batch berhasil",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": \"mahasiswa\",\n  \"results\": [\n    { \"prediction\": 0, \"label\": \"Tidak Selamat\", \"confidence\": 0.87, \"cached\": false, \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\" },\n    { \"prediction\": 1, \"label\": \"Selamat\", \"confidence\": 0.91, \"cached\": false, \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\" },\n    { \"prediction\": 0, \"label\": \"Tidak Selamat\", \"confidence\": 0.75, \"cached\": false, \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\" },\n    { \"prediction\": 1, \"label\": \"Selamat\", \"confidence\": 0.82, \"cached\": false, \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\" }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 4,\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-15T10:31:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "ML Health Check (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{express_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/api/ml-health",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "ml-health"]
            },
            "description": "Cek apakah ML service sedang berjalan dan Redis terhubung."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Predict — Validasi Gagal (features salah)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{express_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"features\": [5, 0, 22, 1, 0, 7.25]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{express_url}}/api/predict",
              "host": ["{{express_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predict"]
            },
            "description": "Test validasi: Pclass=5 di luar range (1-3), seharusnya return 400."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🐍 FastAPI ML Service (Langsung)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ml_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{ml_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Cek status ML service dan koneksi Redis."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Service OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"python-ml-fastapi\",\n  \"cache\": \"connected\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login FastAPI ML",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ml_token', res.access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('ML Token tersimpan', () => pm.expect(res.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"password\": \"alitkicau\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ml_url}}/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{ml_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Login langsung ke FastAPI. Password default: `alitkicau`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Predict Langsung ke FastAPI",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{ml_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"features\": [3, 0, 22, 1, 0, 7.25],\n  \"user_id\": \"test-user-001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ml_url}}/predict",
              "host": ["{{ml_url}}"],
              "path": ["predict"]
            },
            "description": "Panggil ML service langsung tanpa melalui Express Gateway."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Batch Predict Langsung ke FastAPI",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{ml_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"features\": [1, 1, 29, 0, 0, 211.34] },\n    { \"features\": [3, 0, 22, 1, 0, 7.25] }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ml_url}}/batch-predict",
              "host": ["{{ml_url}}"],
              "path": ["batch-predict"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}